    "text": "Har Ghar Tiranga: CRPF Holds Grand Tiranga Rally In J&K, Sends Powerful Unity Message\nThe CRPF organised a grand Tiranga rally in Jammu and Kashmir as part of the Har Ghar Tiranga campaign, with personnel carrying the national flag and spreading a message of unity and patriotism. The rally showcased the force's participation in the nationwide initiative and highlighted the significance of the Tricolour across the region. Watch the full report for visuals from the rally and the latest developments from Jammu and Kashmir. INTERNATIONAL NEWS\nLatest Web Stories\nView All",
